MAHARASHTRA ACT No. XXV OF 2016. (First published, after having received the assent of the Governor in the “ Maharashtra Government Gazette ”, on the 8th August 2016). An Act further to amend the Maharashtra Zilla Parishads and Panchayat Samitis Act, 1961. WHEREAS both Houses of the State Legislature were not in session ;

AND WHEREAS the Governor of Maharashtra was satisfied that circumstances existed which rendered it necessary for him to take immediate action further to amend the Maharashtra Zilla Parishads and Panchayat Samitis Act, 1961, for the purposes hereinafter appearing ; and, therefore, promulgated the Maharashtra Zilla Parishads and Panchayat Samitis (Amendment) Ordinance, 2016, on the 1st June 2016 ;

